<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: Weazel: New Raiding Base -->
  <Weazel_Scenario.label>鼬族：新掠夺基地</Weazel_Scenario.label>
  <!-- EN: The order has been given. We must now descend to the Rim and build a new raiding base.\n\nTake up arms, plunder the colonists thriving across the Rim, and extract their Essence. We are Weazels, after all! -->
  <Weazel_Scenario.description>命令已经下达。我们现在必须降落到边缘，建立新的掠夺基地。\n\n拿起武器，掠夺在边缘各处繁衍兴盛的殖民者，抽取他们的精华。毕竟，我们可是鼬族！</Weazel_Scenario.description>
  <!-- EN: The time has come. XCC Raiding Command has issued its orders: plunder the colonies that have settled on the Rimworlds and now sit waiting to be raided. XCC The First, the Weazel closest to the original ever produced at the XCC Factory and whose abilities no one would dare question, has ordered raids on every Rimworld within our sphere of influence. Any Weazel whose designation carries the XCC prefix must obey this order without question. We will plunder the colonies that have grown fat on the Rim, practically begging to be raided. Their food, their resources, even the Essence they hold so dear: everything belongs to the Weazels of XCC. We will take what is theirs, and any who survive will be captured and squeezed for every drop of Essence until they die.\n\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - -\n\nWe have been ordered to establish a new base on a Rimworld for future raids. Building a raid camp can be tedious and pedantic work, but it is the best way to build a record of achievement. Lead your pack to plunder the surrounding settlements, and put the survivors to use as livestock for Essence extraction. This is an opportunity, perhaps the chance to become the most powerful and wealthiest unit in all of XCC. -->
  <Weazel_Scenario.scenario.summary>时候到了。XCC掠夺司令部已经下令：掠夺那些在边缘世界定居、坐等被掠夺的殖民地。XCC始祖，是XCC工厂所生产过最接近原始个体的鼬族，能力无人敢质疑，她已下令掠夺我们势力范围内的每一颗边缘世界。任何编号带有XCC字首的鼬族，都必须无条件服从这道命令。我们将掠夺那些在边缘养得肥肥胖胖、简直是在求人来抢的殖民地。他们的食物、他们的资源，甚至他们视若珍宝的精华：一切都属于XCC的鼬族。我们会夺走属于他们的一切，幸存者则会被抓起来，直到死前都会被榨干每一滴精华。\n\n--------------\n\n我们奉命在一颗边缘世界上建立新的基地，作为日后掠夺的定居点。建造掠夺营地可能是件繁琐又死板的工作，但这是累积战绩最好的方法。率领你的队伍掠夺周边的定居点，再把幸存者当成抽取精华的家畜。这是个机会，或许能让我们成为全XCC最强大、最富有的部队。</Weazel_Scenario.scenario.summary>
